Here is a concise JavaScript function to find the largest number in an array:

```javascript
function findLargest(arr) {
  if (!arr.length) return undefined; // Handle empty arrays
  let max = arr[0];
  for (let i = 1; i < arr.length; i++) {
    if (arr[i] > max) {
      max = arr[i];
    }
  }
  return max;
}
```

This function iterates through the array, comparing each element to track the maximum value found so far.

